个，不能double dipping", "like_count": 2, "author_id": "UCWny7X0zvMyE5Tn4WA9pO6Q", "author": "@ImTingTing", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mfkQq76S3riJs760GPezIbSd4K4ppTVHPymTWEMBLI0w=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": true, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ImTingTing", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgxZbrmAWU_Crau7_-l4AaABAg.AWJkydE8dqvAWJxQ7oU4W3", "parent": "UgxZbrmAWU_Crau7_-l4AaABAg.AWJkydE8dqvAWJt5tZNEwg", "text": "​ @ImTingTing 有兩位中文理財博主和chatgpt都說可以double dip,感覺很混淆！", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCXbFdveaWZ738P3hpCSDDNQ", "author": "@中邦田", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/phkSe5aMUPotw4jNmnNJt02IZK5glTpg08hVFY-UFXoTMQMtyG2rOkK2QPEsV5HDQrXBJFM-gME=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@%E4%B8%AD%E9%82%A6%E7%94%B0", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "Ugw8NcqWa7I75ZC4bzx4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "请问要想拿GIS，是否一定要先申请OAS？ 谢谢", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UC09i2-pPXaD6fTQG-_3J5qQ", "author": "@yunyue1761", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m8p_hkkEGqUTyF0fq_Csu2cXZ5iJYlUdHztJVZMYk=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@yunyue1761", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "Ugw8NcqWa7I75ZC4bzx4AaABAg.AWJkTPdOJ5CAWJtHW97pjV", "parent": "Ugw8NcqWa7I75ZC4bzx4AaABAg", "text": "是的，必须已经在拿OAS才可以拿到GIS。如果推迟了OAS领取，期间则也拿不到GIS", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCWny7X0zvMyE5Tn4WA9pO6Q", "author": "@ImTingTing", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mfkQq76S3riJs760GPezIbSd4K4ppTVHPymTWEMBLI0w=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": true, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ImTingTing", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "Ugw8NcqWa7I75ZC4bzx4AaABAg.AWJkTPdOJ5CAWLXoIJw4br", "parent": "Ugw8NcqWa7I75ZC4bzx4AaABAg", "text": "谢谢🙏 CPP 是可以不一起申请的对吧？", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UC09i2-pPXaD6fTQG-_3J5qQ", "author": "@yunyue1761", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m8p_hkkEGqUTyF0fq_Csu2cXZ5iJYlUdHztJVZMYk=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@yunyue1761", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "Ugw8NcqWa7I75ZC4bzx4AaABAg.AWJkTPdOJ5CAWM8fq5bEA0", "parent": "Ugw8NcqWa7I75ZC4bzx4AaABAg.AWJkTPdOJ5CAWLXoIJw4br", "text": "对的，CPP可以在不同时间单独申请。", "like_count": 1, "author_id": "UCWny7X0zvMyE5Tn4WA9pO6Q", "author": "@ImTingTing", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mfkQq76S3riJs760GPezIbSd4K4ppTVHPymTWEMBLI0w=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": true, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ImTingTing", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgxaNL8XXfF8b5WUqzZ4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "拿GIS，需要单独申请吗？有RRSP还能拿吗？", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCoxKKJqisEBJsGits-HeALA", "author": "@jianguodeng3077", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_l7zQMeGJEeBTqKHELp6JeoQNdWH0rDAdgIa0PXA9tC3Q=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jianguodeng3077", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "3 days ago", "timestamp": 1777766400, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgxaNL8XXfF8b5WUqzZ4AaABAg.AWJa4vSlyP0AWJuw6u_-Uw", "parent": "UgxaNL8XXfF8b5WUqzZ4AaABAg", "text": "你好，如果你已经在拿OAS则不需要单独申请，政府会根据你上一年的收入决定你是否符合GIS领取标准以及可以拿到多少GIS (每年按照上一年报税收入重新评估一次）。如果你还没有拿OAS, 大多数人政府会自动帮你注册OAS，但是如果在你64岁零1个月的时候没有收到政府OAS自动注册确认信则大概需要手动申请，建议申请前打电话去Service Canada 确认情况是否已自动注册。\n\nRRSP不取出不算收入，取出时算收入会减少GIS。是否可以拿到GIS要看你加上取出RRSP/RRIF的总收入。如果总收入在规定额度以下，则还是可以拿GIS。具体可以用我视频里讲到的退休收入计算器按照你的收入算一下是否可以拿到GIS和可以拿到多少。", "like_count": 1, "author_id": "UCWny7X0zvMyE5Tn4WA9pO6Q", "author": "@ImTingTing", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mfkQq76S3riJs760GPezIbSd4K4ppTVHPymTWEMBLI0w=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": true, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ImTingTing", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago (edited)", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgxaNL8XXfF8b5WUqzZ4AaABAg.AWJa4vSlyP0AWK7-b1geWQ", "parent": "UgxaNL8XXfF8b5WUqzZ4AaABAg.AWJa4vSlyP0AWJuw6u_-Uw", "text": " @ImTingTing  谢谢你的回答，非常清楚，我明白了。", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCoxKKJqisEBJsGits-HeALA", "author": "@jianguodeng3077", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_l7zQMeGJEeBTqKHELp6JeoQNdWH0rDAdgIa0PXA9tC3Q=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jianguodeng3077", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "Ugy6y5Dq2aKUKCfKuIJ4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "Thanks for the info which is very helpful. 另外看到你视频下的链接有医疗保险，请问有没有回中国养老可以买的医疗保险？", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCnveHZL0Uzcs4AnhpU-532Q", "author": "@billliang6730", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m5cgKOLTFMuysvHXamkO09Vopm_3L72BBTUZYCpts=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@billliang6730", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "3 days ago", "timestamp": 1777766400, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "Ugy6y5Dq2aKUKCfKuIJ4AaABAg.AWJU3-8hFz1AWJXtvj0XZB", "parent": "Ugy6y5Dq2aKUKCfKuIJ4AaABAg", "text": "你好，这个需要回国后在中国境内购买商业医疗保险-国内各大保险公司都提供这种保险，如平安保险。在加拿大买的话就只能买旅游保险，不适合长居。", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCWny7X0zvMyE5Tn4WA9pO6Q", "author": "@ImTingTing", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mfkQq76S3riJs760GPezIbSd4K4ppTVHPymTWEMBLI0w=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": true, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ImTingTing", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "3 days ago", "timestamp": 1777766400, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "Ugy6y5Dq2aKUKCfKuIJ4AaABAg.AWJU3-8hFz1AWM20cWbrDS", "parent": "Ugy6y5Dq2aKUKCfKuIJ4AaABAg.AWJU3-8hFz1AWJXtvj0XZB", "text": " @ImTingTing  Thanks a lot", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCnveHZL0Uzcs4AnhpU-532Q", "author": "@billliang6730", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m5cgKOLTFMuysvHXamkO09Vopm_3L72BBTUZYCpts=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@billliang6730", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "2 days ago", "timestamp": 1777852800, "is_pinned": false}], "asr": 44100, "filesize": 34605174, "format_id": "18", "format_note": "360p", "source_preference": -1, "fps": 30, "audio_channels": 2, "height": 360, "quality": 6.0, "has_drm": false, "tbr": 219.693, "filesize_approx": 34605025, "width": 640, "language_preference": -1, "ext": "mp4", "vcodec": "avc1.42001E", "acodec": "mp4a.40.2", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "url": "https://rr2---sn-ci5gup-w5pz.googlevideo.com/videoplayback?expire=1778024835&ei=Iy36abrzDeiessUP1e6cqAU&ip=106.219.68.140&id=o-AK97HZVkMhABG6flTc7gT46QXCXqrjy2k7HCuAx5w3gh&itag=18&source=youtube&requiressl=yes&xpc=EgVo2aDSNQ%3D%3D&cps=203&met=1778003235%2C&mh=AK&mm=31%2C29&mn=sn-ci5gup-w5pz%2Csn-ci5gup-qxay&ms=au%2Crdu&mv=m&mvi=2&pcm2cms=yes&pl=23&rms=au%2Cau&initcwndbps=1558750&bui=AbKmrwo2TuJfkj_P2IpkwRTfxQdcDCBn8xyyZrl3wr_HMEBuB1ichk_OFqC92JOvSF8z40CAgEg8bwgp&spc=96Xrvyp4mLZ46_IZ3l7saqCibxDKyWolA4N03uvx3vJkm_-8X0F9q0GhUPV6XaFSpEA&vprv=1&svpuc=1&mime=video%2Fmp4&rqh=1&gir=yes&clen=34605174&ratebypass=yes&dur=1260.123&lmt=1777750012801154&mt=1778002887&fvip=7&